Now for a summary of my latest game, a penetration down to level 27 (and
I haven't read source since 2.2 :-))  Died stupidly after choking on a
titan corpse :-(  Well, anyway Slayer the Barbarian had armor class -33, a
+6 long sword named Flame Brand, speed boots, a +6 cloak of displacement,
and lots and lots of luck (sacrificing dragons and giants at altars works
wonders for your relationship with your god).  My god had given me the magic
tune to open the castle, and I was killing all dragons with two or three hits,
occasionally with one.

I did find something that appears to be a bug, however; my god had
caused a ring of mine to glow faintly with a blue aura, and the blessing
that already was on it seemingly went away.  At the time I had two
protection rings, one of which was blessed and one which was not.


